			"notes": "- gay grass:\n  - add png support\n  - add video support, disabled by default, and no videos included by default\n  - add option to apply colors to all tinted blocks\n  - rotations changed to allow groups of nearby flags can have similar rotations\n  - add ability to force camera to target the rotation for that position, for filming the bad apple video\n- redfile:\n  - tracking method changed to more accurately capture more things\n    - ensures that only one world is processed at a time to improve tracking\n  - now uses several trials as opposed to one continuous run\n  - now reports in confidence intervals for the average\n  - can now break down results by tags, ie functions\n    - epic pie chart that reports breakdown by tag with uncertainty\n    - can ignore specific tags when viewing heatmap + piechart\n  - new end condition: signal, which listens for a command block to send the signal saying to finish (or finish after a certain number of signals)\n  - new run type: compare, similar to average but comparing two runs\n  - client command changed to \"redfilec\"\n- suppression blocks\n  - add suppression blocks, which disable certain behaviors on their surrounding blocks"
		},
